{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────みんな赤い衣装だなぁ","trans":"────大家都穿着红色的衣服啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"店員さんたちがさ、ほら\r\nいよいよクリスマスって感じがするよ","trans":"你看那些店员\n总算有种圣诞节的感觉了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"あ、口元\r\n……ほら、ケチャップ","trans":"啊，嘴边\n……你看，番茄酱","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901026460020","name":"凛世","text":"……！\r\nし、失礼……いたしました……","trans":"……！\n失、失礼了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901026460040","name":"凛世","text":"ふふ……\r\nプロデューサーさまも……口元に……","trans":"呵呵……\n制作人大人嘴边也……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901026460050","name":"凛世","text":"赤い赤い……\r\nケチャップ……","trans":"红红的……\n番茄酱……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}